# Build context is the repo root, so this keeps the image lean and — more
# importantly — keeps local state out of it. content.db in particular must NOT
# ship: production's database lives on the volume, and copying a local one in
# would overwrite or shadow it.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.git
**/.claude
web/content.db
web/*.db
web/migration-check.db
web/media
web/.env
.env
**/.DS_Store
**/npm-debug.log*
**/*.tsbuildinfo
